// Multi-module workspace.
//
// Four modules live in this repository, and they are separate on purpose:
//
//   .                the control plane
//   ./pkg/proxmox    the Proxmox client — consumed by BOTH the API and the agent
//   ./sdk/go         the generated API client — consumed by the agent
//   ./agent          the fleet agent (Bees), which runs as root on every hypervisor
//
// The agent is why pkg/proxmox is its own module. Left inside the control plane's
// module, an agent that wanted to call a hypervisor would have to require the
// whole control plane — huma, gorm, river, webauthn — to do it. Its dependency
// graph from this repository is now exactly two lean things.
//
// The workspace is what keeps that from costing anything day to day: local
// builds resolve the sibling modules from disk, so a change to pkg/proxmox is
// visible to the API and the agent immediately, with no replace directives to
// remember and no version to bump between commits.
go 1.27.3

use (
	.
	./agent
	./pkg/proxmox
	./sdk/go
)
